## Task B: I2 Arousal-Only Analysis

| Quadrant | I2 Aro (Switching) | I2 Aro (Non-Switching) | p-value |
|---|---|---|---|
| Q1 | 2.991 | 2.967 | 0.372 |
| Q2 | 2.980 | 3.018 | 0.367 |
| Q3 | 2.982 | 2.957 | 0.549 |
| Q4 | 2.985 | 2.986 | 0.994 |

**No switching effect on I2 arousal in any quadrant.** Arousal carryover correlation: r=0.008 (switching), r=-0.035 (non-switching). **The Llama model's 1Hz Fitbit inference provides no discriminative signal for emotional switching.**

